<h3>PageTwo — Received Value</h3>
<p>Name received: <strong>@ViewBag.Name</strong></p>
<p>Transferred via: <strong>@ViewBag.Method</strong></p>

@if (ViewBag.Method == "Query String")
{
    <p>Check the URL above — the name is visible as <code>?userName=...</code></p>
}
else
{
    <p>The name was submitted via POST inside a hidden <code>&lt;input type="hidden"&gt;</code> field — not visible in the URL.</p>
}